{
  "version": "0.7.4",
  "default_profile": "preserve",
  "note": "相对密度数字是历史内部启发值，不是可测量的厂商参数；保留、简化或丰富由当前任务决定，不能自动删减刺绣。",
  "profiles": {
    "preserve": {
      "primary_ornament_growth_pct_max": 0,
      "secondary_ornament_growth_pct_max": 10,
      "micro_detail_growth_pct_max": 10,
      "mechanical_module_growth_pct_max": 0,
      "chain_tassel_growth_pct_max": 0,
      "new_zone_density_rule": "match_reference_mean_not_peak",
      "prompt_translation": [
        "保持可见参考的设计密度，不用额外装饰填满新延展区域。",
        "补全部位延续主装饰、机械构件、链条、流苏和标志纹样的既有层级，不自动增加其数量。"
      ]
    },
    "reduce": {
      "primary_ornament_growth_pct_max": -20,
      "secondary_ornament_growth_pct_max": -20,
      "micro_detail_growth_pct_max": -10,
      "mechanical_module_growth_pct_max": -15,
      "chain_tassel_growth_pct_max": -25,
      "new_zone_density_rule": "below_reference_mean",
      "prompt_translation": [
        "只有本轮明确允许简化时，减少已识别的装饰堆积并保留核心辨识纹样，具体说明删减位置。",
        "用结构、剪裁、面料质量与材质对比呈现丰富感，不自动增加金属件。"
      ]
    },
    "enrich": {
      "primary_ornament_growth_pct_max": 0,
      "secondary_ornament_growth_pct_max": 20,
      "micro_detail_growth_pct_max": 25,
      "mechanical_module_growth_pct_max": 10,
      "chain_tassel_growth_pct_max": 10,
      "new_zone_density_rule": "up_to_reference_peak",
      "prompt_translation": [
        "只有本轮允许丰富细节时，加入有限的辅助细节，保持原有主次与设计家族。"
      ]
    }
  }
}
